  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Perfectly positioned just a short stroll from Mission Bay Beach, cafés and vibrant local eateries, this beautifully refreshed family home offers the rare combination of generous land, contemporary comfort and effortless lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSet on an impressive 910m² (more or less) site with approximately 290m² of living space, the home features four spacious bedrooms, three bathrooms, multiple living areas and seamless indoor-outdoor flow to an expansive entertaining terrace overlooking your own private swimming pool.\r\n\r\nFreshly renovated with new interior and exterior paint, this move-in-ready residence delivers style, space and flexibility for growing families or those who simply love to entertain.\r\n\r\nFeatures you’ll love:\r\n• 910m² freehold section (approx.)\r\n• Approx. 290m² modern family home\r\n• 4 generous bedrooms & 3 bathrooms\r\n• Private swimming pool\r\n• Expansive sun-soaked entertaining deck\r\n• Fresh interior & exterior repaint\r\n• Multiple living spaces plus study\r\n• Walk to Mission Bay Beach, cafés, restaurants and local shops\r\n• Easy access to the CBD and Eastern Bays\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a substantial family home in one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal suburbs.",
